('Sled Push (Loaded)', 'Drive a weighted sled forward across a set distance.', 'conditioning', '{quads,glutes,core}', '{sled}', 'intermediate', E'Low shin angle, drive through the whole foot\nShort powerful steps\nExhale forcefully each push', '{}', false),
